# Logging (Important)

Measure latency:

```python
import time

t0 = time.time()

response = requests.post(...)

latency = time.time() - t0

print(latency)
```

Useful logs:

```python
logger.info(
    "llm_call",
    extra={
        "latency": latency,
        "prompt_length": len(prompt)
    }
)
```

This helps identify:

* slow prompts
* overloaded providers
* timeout tuning opportunities

